Step 08 Route B FFT-guided adaptive window prototype 4b
Prototype scope: keep FFT coarse center fixed, adapt theta_search_B and routeB_beam_span from FFT peak FWHM.
Route comparison: baseline_true_centerT vs fft_guided_centerT vs fft_guided_centerT_adaptive_window.
Common experiment settings:
snr_list=[14 16 18 20 22 24 26 28], Metkl=200, T_snap=260, tol_deg=0.100
sep_factor_list=[6 7 8 9 10]
Route B internal settings: K_fbss=56, M_full=48, center_beam_count=37, search_scale_B=4.00
FFT settings: Nfft_spatial=4096, FWHM-driven adaptive window with gamma_search=1.20, gamma_span=1.50.
Adaptive bounds: search in [0.60, 1.60] x fixed, span in [0.80, 1.60] x fixed.

